00:09:31.060 --> 00:09:33.940
But it is helpful to have
a default port in case

00:09:33.940 --> 00:09:37.780
that environment
variable is not set.

00:09:37.780 --> 00:09:41.500
So for this, I'll do 8080.

00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:44.930
And then we need to
register our handler,

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:48.590
so we'll do http.HandleFunc.

00:09:48.590 --> 00:09:52.430
Listen on our port.

00:09:52.430 --> 00:09:57.080
Use the default-- or the
handler that we just wrote,

00:09:57.080 --> 00:10:00.710
