00:10:07.087 --> 00:10:08.420
That's what I was saying before.

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:10.340
All of the packages
that we create

00:10:10.340 --> 00:10:13.730
are just prefixed
by that module path.

00:10:13.730 --> 00:10:16.090
We'll see that in a sec.

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:20.820
Let's log a message that says
